227				`\`${LOCALIZE_POLYFILL_ENTRY_POINT}\` entry point installs the runtime before \`main\`, ` +
228				`because ${String(reading.markers.length)} i18n markers across ` +
229				`${String(reading.markedTemplates.length)} of this application's ` +
230				`${String(reading.templatesRead)} templates compile to \`$localize\` tagged templates ` +
